{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"EZK","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"以西结书","commonName":"以西结书","title":"以西结书","order":26,"numberOfChapters":48,"sha256":"b300d2a00ef4238c256f8a9d29bc0a1d295803bb4dc8e9a92c0dd26615335564","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/EZK/1.json","lastChapterNumber":48,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/EZK/48.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1271},"chapter":{"number":30,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["为埃及唱哀歌"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["耶和华对我说："]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["“人子啊，你要说预言，宣告主耶和华这样说，",{"text":"“‘哀号吧！你们要为那日悲伤。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为日子近了，耶和华的日子近了，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那将是乌云密布的日子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是列国沦亡的时候。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必有刀剑攻击埃及，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"埃及必尸横遍野，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"古实必痛苦不堪。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"敌人要掳掠埃及的财富，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"摧毁她的根基。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"古实、弗、路德、阿拉伯和利比亚及其他盟友都必与她一同死于刀下。’","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"“耶和华说，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"‘埃及的盟友都要覆灭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"埃及的傲气必荡然无存，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"从密夺到色弗尼的居民都要丧身刀下。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是主耶和华说的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"埃及要变成荒地中的荒地，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她的城邑要沦为废墟中的废墟。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要点火烧埃及，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"埃及的所有盟友都要灭亡。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那时，他们就知道我是耶和华。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["“‘在那日，我要差遣使者乘船出去惊吓安逸的古实人，在埃及遭难的日子，他们必痛苦不堪。看啊，这日子快到了。’"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["“主耶和华说，",{"text":"“‘我要借巴比伦王尼布甲尼撒的手消灭埃及的百姓。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他和追随他的都是万民中最残暴的人。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们去毁灭埃及，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"拔刀攻击那里，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使埃及尸骨遍野。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要使尼罗河干涸，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"把土地卖给恶人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要借外族人的手使埃及及其境内的一切都荒废，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是我耶和华说的。’","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"text":"“主耶和华说，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"‘我要毁灭偶像，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"铲除挪弗的神像。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"埃及再没有君王，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要使埃及境内充满恐惧。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要使巴特罗荒废，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"放火焚烧琐安，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"审判底比斯。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要把我的烈怒倾倒在埃及的训堡垒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"消灭底比斯的百姓。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要放火烧埃及，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"训必受极大的痛苦，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"底比斯要被攻破，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"挪弗终日困苦不已，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"亚文和比伯实的壮丁必死于刀下，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"众城都要遭受掳掠。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我粉碎埃及势力的那天，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"答比匿必日月无光，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她的锐气全消。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"乌云必笼罩她，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她城邑的居民必被掳去。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必这样审判埃及，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们就知道我是耶和华。’”","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":["第十一年一月七日，耶和华对我说："]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":["“人子啊，我打断了埃及王法老的一只臂膀，没有人替他敷药包扎，以致他无力拿刀。"]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":["因此，主耶和华说，‘我要与埃及王法老为敌，我要把他那强壮的臂膀和曾经受伤的臂膀一起打断，使刀从他手中掉落。"]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":["我要把埃及人驱散到列国，分散到列邦。"]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":["我要使巴比伦王的臂膀强壮有力，把我的刀交在他手中。我要打断法老的臂膀，使法老在他面前像受了致命伤的人一样呻吟。"]},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":["我要使巴比伦王的臂膀强壮有力，而法老的双臂必软弱无力。我要把我的刀交在巴比伦王手中，让他挥刀攻击埃及。那时他们就知道我是耶和华。"]},{"type":"verse","number":26,"content":["我要把埃及人驱散到列国，分散到列邦，这样他们就知道我是耶和华。’”"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/EZK/30.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/EZK/31.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/EZK/29.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":26}